<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Spanish first division</p>
<p>soccer matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Sevilla 0 Deportivo Coruna 1 (Corentin Martins 50). Halftime</p>
<p>0-0. 40,000.</p>
<p>Logrones 3 (Ricardo Canals 14 pen, Jose Luis Morales 35, 60)</p>
<p>Hercules 2 (Paquito Escudero 27, Josip Visnijc 45). 2-2. 13,000.</p>
<p>Compostela 0 Real Betis 2 (Alfonso Perez 7, Finidi George 73).</p>
<p>0-1. 8,000.</p>
<p>Zaragoza 1 (Gustavo Poyet 34) Oviedo 0. 1-0. 18,000.</p>
<p>Real Sociedad 1 (Hakan Mild 20) Espanyol 0. 1-0. 18,000.</p>
<p>Valladolid 0 Athletic Bilbao 0. 20,000.</p>
